@startuml
title Компоненты Deposits Gateway (расширение)

package "Deposits Gateway" {
  [Admin Web UI] --> [Rate Management Service]
  [Rate Management Service] --> (MS SQL: deposit_products)
  
  [Rate Distribution Service] --> (MS SQL: deposit_products)
  [Rate Distribution Service] --> [Call Center API Client]
  [Rate Distribution Service] --> [SFTP File Publisher]
}

[Call Center API Client] --> (Система кол-центра\nREST API)
[SFTP File Publisher] --> (SFTP-сервер партнёра)

note right of [Rate Distribution Service]
  Запускается по расписанию\n(Cron / Kubernetes Job)
end note
@enduml